	upgradeDescription(1)="Your pyrokinetic sight reveals <font color=\"#e80948\">Cloaked ZEDs</font> and <font color=\"#e80948\">Enemy Health</font>. <font color=\"#e85009\">Headshots</font> deal <font color=\"#e85009\">60%</font> more damage. Greatly increases <font color=\"#e80948\">Cloak Detection Range</font>."
